.SH NAME
peers-service-run - Run the local Broker in the foreground


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpeers service run [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
run starts the local Broker in the foreground. The service definitions start the Broker this way.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--allow-degraded\fP[=false]
	keep running and report failures on the local socket instead of exiting

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for run

.PP
\fB--listen\fP=""
	listen address, overriding broker.listen

.PP
\fB--system\fP[=false]
	operate on the system installation

.PP
\fB--user\fP[=false]
	operate on this account's installation


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpeers-service(1)\fP


